Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 11/20] FreeChat: batch existence checks, no redirects with the
 token; drop dead code

- Existence checks are sent in batches of 500, the server limit; larger
  timelines used to get a 400 and never learned what was purged.
- FreeChat requests do not follow redirects, so the access token cannot be
  sent to another host.
- The unused expired-redaction helper is gone.
